OL,12,     Felectric folding mobility
OL,13,     Fscooters.
OL,14,G0800 Cruising with Susan Calman
OL,15,     FThe presenter jets off to New York
OL,16,     Fwhere she enjoys a spectacular
OL,17,     Fhelicopter ride before boarding
OL,18,     Fher cruise. Later, she heads to
OL,19,     FBoston for a trolleybus tour and a
OL,20,     Fbaseball lesson.
