OL,11,G0100 Acts of Murder
OL,12,     FWhen Stacey Peterson went missing,
OL,13,     Fher husband Drew Peterson became
OL,14,     Fthe prime suspect. But Peterson's
OL,15,     Fobsession with news shows would
OL,16,     Feventually contribute to his
